# Not integrated into Pulse or PulseDebug — no file in either is touched by this addon.
# Reaches Pulse the same read-only way PulseDebug already does, through the _G.Pulse
# handle Core/Init.lua exposes for exactly this purpose (Registry/Triggers only, never
# writes anything back). Own SavedVariables table, own standalone window, own slash
# command — /pulsecheck (or /pcheck) toggles it, not tucked into Interface Options.

